# PSG · Solo Developer Workflow

**SSOT:** [registry/psg-solo-developer-workflow.v1.yaml](../../registry/psg-solo-developer-workflow.v1.yaml) · [TT-PSG-SOLO-DEVELOPER-WORKFLOW-LATEST.md](../../docs/runbook/TT-PSG-SOLO-DEVELOPER-WORKFLOW-LATEST.md)

**Baseline:** `v1.1.0-psg-go.20260717` · `TT_PRODUCTION_GO: GO`

## Default model

Hotfix / Patch / Feature / new Release → **Owner Self Review + Owner Sign-off + Release Archive**.

**Keep:** Gate · Evidence · Freeze · Certification · Release Baseline · Release Archive.

**Do not require for PSG/GO:** Pull Request approval · Code Reviewer · Approver · Merge Request · dual-person sign-off · merge host.

## Agent MUST

- Branch from frozen baseline Tag/SHA for product changes
- Prefer Owner Self Review language over “needs PR / Reviewer”
- Preserve Archive immutability; new formal release = new cycle + new Archive

## Agent MUST NOT

- Block work waiting for a second human Approver
- Waive Gates because the maintainer is Solo
- Mutate `release_archive/v1.1.0-psg-go.20260717/`
- Re-run PASS Gates only to refresh the frozen GO pack
- Cite TT-9628 dual-owner as a Production GO hard gate (LEGACY optional team only)
